WEBVTT

00:07.625 --> 00:09.025
SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

02:03.945 --> 02:05.505
<i>After that day,</i>

02:06.025 --> 02:08.665
<i>it feels like Luan Nian</i>
<i>has put a spell on me.</i>

02:09.425 --> 02:11.625
<i>He unlocked the secret of my desire.</i>

02:15.505 --> 02:16.825
<i>Did you notice?</i>

02:17.505 --> 02:18.785
<i>You cannot control the feelings of love.</i>

02:20.185 --> 02:22.425
<i>And all those years,</i>
<i>he made me long for more.</i>

02:22.505 --> 02:24.065
<i>He drove me crazy and lived in my mind.</i>

02:24.985 --> 02:27.425
<i>Shang Zhitao, are you sober?</i>

02:28.625 --> 02:30.585
<i>Do you understand</i>
<i>what's going to happen next?</i>

02:30.665 --> 02:32.985
<i>I spent six years</i>

02:33.585 --> 02:36.265
<i>in this shameful, hidden relationship.</i>

02:37.225 --> 02:39.705
<i>There were grievances, pain,</i>

02:40.785 --> 02:42.585
<i>and joy.</i>

02:43.825 --> 02:48.385
<i>Yet I can never</i>
<i>take the first step to leave him.</i>

02:51.225 --> 02:55.825
ADAPTED FROM <i>THE EARLY SPRING</i> ON JJWXC.NET
AUTHOR: GU NIANG BIE KU

02:58.225 --> 03:01.705
"YOU ARE NOT SUITABLE"

04:17.184 --> 04:18.785
<i>The interview is about to begin, Luke.</i>

04:19.745 --> 04:21.425
Shang Zhitao.

04:22.225 --> 04:25.025
Hi. I am Liang Xin, Lime's HR manager.

04:25.105 --> 04:26.505
You can call me Tracy.

04:27.105 --> 04:29.185
Today, your chief interviewer
is Luke Luan.

04:29.785 --> 04:32.305
<i>If you're ready, let's begin.</i>

04:33.185 --> 04:34.225
Okay.

04:35.545 --> 04:36.825
I am Shang Zhitao.

04:36.905 --> 04:38.225
My English name is Flora.

04:38.305 --> 04:41.225
<i>I am from Harbin,</i>
<i>and I attended university in Nanjing.</i>

04:41.305 --> 04:42.545
<i>I'm a fresh graduate.</i>

04:42.625 --> 04:45.025
I would love to work at Lime.

04:45.105 --> 04:47.065
<i>Tell me about your work experience.</i>

04:48.825 --> 04:50.505
MUTE, HANG UP, CAMERA

04:52.105 --> 04:53.225
Have you done any internships?

04:53.305 --> 04:54.945
If you have, tell us about that.

04:55.025 --> 04:56.145
I have.

04:56.225 --> 04:57.745
While I was in college,

04:57.825 --> 05:00.705
I did some scenic area planning projects
with my classmates.

05:00.785 --> 05:03.665
<i>We planned the event's itinerary,</i>

05:03.745 --> 05:06.905
set up the stage, and worked on posters
and promotional texts.

05:06.985 --> 05:08.185
<i>How big was the project?</i>

05:08.705 --> 05:10.545
There wasn't much funding,

05:10.625 --> 05:12.425
but we were very interested in it,

05:12.505 --> 05:15.265
so we joined with the goal
of gaining experience in mind--

05:15.345 --> 05:16.265
<i>Okay.</i>

05:16.865 --> 05:17.905
Next.

05:25.305 --> 05:27.265
Thank you, Shang Zhitao.

05:27.345 --> 05:29.625
That's all for your interview.

05:29.705 --> 05:31.025
Please go back and wait for our notice.

05:31.105 --> 05:34.665
It wasn't a huge project,
but I gained a lot of experience.

05:34.745 --> 05:36.265
Maybe I can share it with you?

05:36.345 --> 05:39.345
<i>No need. I need someone</i>
<i>with top-tier hands-on experience.</i>

05:39.425 --> 05:41.505
You're not suitable. Next.

05:46.985 --> 05:48.025
Thank you.

05:58.985 --> 06:00.105
Luke.

06:00.185 --> 06:03.585
Is it possible for you to mind
your tone during interviews?

06:03.665 --> 06:05.505
<i>Let them finish speaking, at least.</i>

06:07.065 --> 06:08.145
Sure.

06:16.265 --> 06:17.425
Yao Bei.

06:17.505 --> 06:19.145
I failed the interview.

06:20.425 --> 06:21.425
<i>What happened?</i>

06:21.945 --> 06:24.305
<i>Tao. I have to work overtime today.</i>

06:24.385 --> 06:25.985
<i>Let's meet up and talk another day, okay?</i>

06:26.505 --> 06:30.665
It's okay. I just arrived downstairs
at the flat I'm renting.

06:30.745 --> 06:33.465
Once I find my unit, I'll settle in.

06:33.985 --> 06:36.745
<i>Okay. Take your time planning.</i>
<i>Don't give up.</i>

06:36.825 --> 06:39.865
<i>It's normal to be rejected</i>
<i>by a renowned company like Lime.</i>

06:39.945 --> 06:41.585
<i>Getting in is like winning the lottery.</i>

06:42.305 --> 06:43.425
I know.

06:43.505 --> 06:44.505
All right then.

06:54.105 --> 06:55.785
TIANTONG DONGYUAN, SECTION 1

07:32.305 --> 07:33.225
Looking for someone?

07:34.145 --> 07:35.425
Sorry to bother you.

07:35.505 --> 07:37.545
I'm the new tenant.

07:37.625 --> 07:38.625
I contacted Zhang Lei.

07:41.745 --> 07:42.985
He's the landlord.

07:43.545 --> 07:44.625
Come in.

07:49.745 --> 07:50.825
Your room is here.

08:11.985 --> 08:15.465
<i>It wasn't a huge project,</i>
<i>but I gained a lot of experience.</i>

08:15.545 --> 08:17.905
-<i>Maybe I can share them with you?</i>
-<i>No need.</i>

08:17.985 --> 08:20.185
<i>You're not suitable. Next.</i>

08:24.945 --> 08:26.465
He didn't even let me finish.

08:28.865 --> 08:29.865
It's okay.

08:30.785 --> 08:33.545
Man proposes, God disposes.

08:42.945 --> 08:44.985
<i>Tao. Have you arrived in Beijing?</i>

08:45.065 --> 08:46.265
<i>Have you settled in?</i>

08:46.345 --> 08:48.385
<i>How are your unit and your housemate?</i>

08:52.505 --> 08:54.225
<i>I've arrived. Everything is good.</i>

08:54.305 --> 08:55.505
<i>Don't worry.</i>

09:03.145 --> 09:04.105
FOLLOW-UP E-MAIL TO LIME ADVERTISING
REGARDING MY WORK EXPERIENCE

09:04.185 --> 09:05.185
I AM AN ADVERTISING STUDENT AT JINLING
UNIVERSITY OF FINANCE AND ECONOMICS

09:05.265 --> 09:06.185
I'VE FOLLOWED LIME'S OUTSTANDING WORK
IN BRANDING AND CREATIVE PLANNING

09:06.265 --> 09:08.025
A habitual thief, aren't you?

09:08.105 --> 09:09.945
You keep stealing
my detergent and shampoo.

09:10.025 --> 09:11.145
Don't you dare make things up.

09:11.225 --> 09:12.665
I could say you stole my rings
and earrings.

09:12.745 --> 09:13.905
Liar!

09:13.985 --> 09:16.105
My bracelet was on the sink counter.

09:16.185 --> 09:17.465
When I came back ten minutes later,
it was gone.

09:17.545 --> 09:19.545
Only you went to the toilet.
So you must be the thief.

09:19.625 --> 09:20.545
I did not steal it.

09:20.625 --> 09:21.865
If you slander us again,
I'll tear your mouth off.

09:21.945 --> 09:24.105
You lost something?
Maybe we should call the police.

09:25.105 --> 09:26.905
Who are you? Why are you in my house?

09:26.985 --> 09:28.105
Right. Call the police.

09:28.185 --> 09:29.345
Now.

09:29.425 --> 09:30.745
Call the police. Where's your phone?

09:30.825 --> 09:32.185
What gives you the right
to say whatever you want?

09:32.265 --> 09:34.065
Look at how crazy you are.

09:34.145 --> 09:35.945
You always look miserable.
No wonder you're single.

09:36.025 --> 09:37.945
Your man lies in bed all day.
He doesn't go to work.

09:38.025 --> 09:39.145
"Honey, wash my socks."

09:39.225 --> 09:40.945
"Honey, wash my underwear."
"Wash it for me."

09:41.025 --> 09:42.785
Is it fun washing someone's
dirty underwear?

09:42.865 --> 09:45.505
-I do what I want.
-Don't fight.

09:45.585 --> 09:46.985
-Don't hit her.
-Move!

09:50.905 --> 09:51.745
Let her go!

09:51.825 --> 09:52.785
Come.

09:54.585 --> 09:55.945
Lock the door.

09:56.025 --> 09:57.385
-Open the door!
-Open the door!

09:57.465 --> 09:58.305
You hit me. I'll call the police.

10:02.785 --> 10:04.345
-Open the door!
-Hello, 110?

10:04.425 --> 10:05.385
I want to make a report.

10:18.305 --> 10:19.345
Come in.

10:23.545 --> 10:25.625
The shortlist
for this graduate recruitment.

10:25.705 --> 10:26.585
Please sign it.

10:28.905 --> 10:31.105
GRADUATE RECRUITMENT SHORTLISTED
CANDIDATES, 5. SHANG ZHITAO

10:33.585 --> 10:34.665
Shang Zhitao?

10:36.185 --> 10:38.865
I thought I rejected her
during the interview.

10:39.465 --> 10:42.225
Yes. You did.

10:42.305 --> 10:43.465
But Luke,

10:43.545 --> 10:46.345
HR is all about diverse employment.

10:46.425 --> 10:48.905
I wasn't born to be an HRBP.

10:48.985 --> 10:50.985
We all went through a learning process.

10:51.625 --> 10:54.305
Our company has fielded
many competent individuals,

10:54.385 --> 10:57.025
but they're all too high up
and out of touch with reality.

10:57.665 --> 11:01.065
If this continues,
the team will have problems.

11:01.905 --> 11:04.385
But we can't recruit someone with
neither qualifications nor experience.

11:05.305 --> 11:06.505
Is she a relative of yours?

11:07.705 --> 11:09.745
Are you doubting my professionalism?

11:09.825 --> 11:11.585
You didn't even let her finish.

11:11.665 --> 11:13.425
After the interview,
she proactively sent me

11:13.505 --> 11:15.225
supplementary materials about her project.

11:15.305 --> 11:17.185
Her feedback in the background check
was the best.

11:17.265 --> 11:18.945
I have discussed this with headquarters.

11:19.025 --> 11:22.665
This time, I'll recruit
some down-to-earth fresh graduates.

11:23.185 --> 11:24.665
Consider this an experiment of mine.

11:25.265 --> 11:28.145
Besides, your Lumi
keeps asking me for more manpower.

11:28.225 --> 11:32.505
Can you please support my endeavor
and sign on the paper?

11:34.665 --> 11:35.825
Fine. This is a favor.

11:36.465 --> 11:38.225
Sure. I owe you one.

11:39.025 --> 11:41.065
The new recruits will report next Monday.

11:41.145 --> 11:42.865
Find some time and meet with them.

11:42.945 --> 11:44.905
You were at the training seminar
last year, right?

11:46.025 --> 11:48.825
I wasn't able to answer those questions.

11:49.425 --> 11:51.585
"Is office romance allowed?"

11:51.665 --> 11:55.625
Tracy, you're the one who decides
who gets to join our company.

11:55.705 --> 11:57.105
Please use your power wisely.

11:57.785 --> 11:58.825
Okay.

11:58.905 --> 12:00.185
I shall return and add

12:00.265 --> 12:02.145
"No asking about
your superior's personal life"

12:02.225 --> 12:05.465
and "No dating
between superiors and subordinates"

12:05.545 --> 12:08.865
to the new recruit's manual
in black and white. Happy?

12:08.945 --> 12:10.825
Congratulations. You've become
more and more professional.

12:12.065 --> 12:13.385
I shall go now.

12:20.265 --> 12:21.665
FARMHOUSE PORK

12:23.785 --> 12:26.425
So, you won't file
a police report anymore?

12:28.145 --> 12:29.865
I've checked with Lei.

12:29.945 --> 12:33.105
He said they had already mentioned
moving out last month.

12:33.185 --> 12:37.545
Why else would they pack up so quickly
and leave while we were hiding?

12:39.385 --> 12:40.585
She stole my things. So be it.

12:40.665 --> 12:42.625
She can have them. I don't need them.

12:42.705 --> 12:43.665
Thank you for today.

12:43.745 --> 12:45.665
I am Sun Yu. What's your name?

12:46.345 --> 12:47.745
I am Shang Zhitao.

12:47.825 --> 12:49.385
Shang Zhitao.

12:52.145 --> 12:53.105
Thank you.

12:54.465 --> 12:57.705
I've never asked you this.
What do you do for work?

12:59.065 --> 12:59.945
Love business.

13:02.305 --> 13:06.865
I work in sales for a dating site.

13:06.945 --> 13:08.585
Isn't that love business?

13:11.825 --> 13:12.865
Where are you from?

13:13.465 --> 13:15.505
Me? I'm from Harbin.

13:15.585 --> 13:17.745
But I went to university in Nanjing.

13:19.465 --> 13:20.465
Nanjing?

13:22.785 --> 13:23.905
My ex is from Nanjing.

13:25.905 --> 13:27.945
I… Sorry.

13:28.025 --> 13:29.345
Don't be.

13:29.425 --> 13:31.105
He should be the one apologizing to me.

13:31.705 --> 13:34.505
He kept saying the feelings had faded.

13:35.025 --> 13:37.225
But I know he thinks
I'm not good enough for him.

13:38.305 --> 13:39.665
In Beijing,

13:40.505 --> 13:43.265
everyone has a price.

13:45.025 --> 13:46.625
They are waiting for the best offer.

13:48.745 --> 13:50.625
You're too good for him.

13:50.705 --> 13:51.745
He will surely regret it.

13:52.625 --> 13:53.985
Impossible.

13:55.505 --> 13:57.145
I won't let him hurt me again.

13:57.865 --> 13:59.025
You're right.

13:59.105 --> 14:01.105
Don't let anyone hurt you again.

14:01.185 --> 14:02.225
Exactly.

14:03.385 --> 14:04.585
Screw love.

14:06.185 --> 14:07.665
I will be rich.

14:09.105 --> 14:12.505
I won't let stupid romance weigh me down.

14:14.105 --> 14:14.945
You have my support.

14:15.025 --> 14:16.665
I agree with you.

14:16.745 --> 14:20.505
When we're self-sufficient,
love will come after us.

14:21.305 --> 14:22.345
Good one.

14:23.745 --> 14:26.105
Meeting you is the beginning
of my good fortune. Thank you.

14:27.665 --> 14:28.505
Actually, I'm the lucky one.

14:28.585 --> 14:30.465
It's my first day in Beijing,
and someone is buying me a meal.

14:30.545 --> 14:32.345
You're so kind and brave.

14:32.905 --> 14:35.505
People will queue up to buy you a meal.

14:36.025 --> 14:37.785
Dig in. You haven't touched anything.

14:55.785 --> 14:59.025
OFFER LETTER
BEIJING LIME ADVERTISING

15:04.065 --> 15:07.505
OFFER LETTER
DEAR SHANG ZHITAO…

15:14.825 --> 15:17.705
Tao, can I come in?

15:20.185 --> 15:22.225
Thank you for today.

15:25.585 --> 15:27.025
What's the matter?

15:27.105 --> 15:28.185
Why are you crying?

15:30.225 --> 15:31.345
What happened?

15:33.105 --> 15:35.665
I… I found a job.

15:35.745 --> 15:37.465
You… You found a job?

15:38.065 --> 15:40.225
-Where?
-Lime.

15:41.465 --> 15:42.665
Lime?

15:42.745 --> 15:43.705
Seriously?

15:43.785 --> 15:46.705
The Lime that made
the Olympic advertisements?

15:47.425 --> 15:49.665
Is this for real, Shang Zhitao?

15:52.385 --> 15:53.745
Beijing Lime.

15:54.385 --> 15:56.545
You're amazing!

15:59.425 --> 16:01.345
I was about to give this to you.

16:01.945 --> 16:03.585
You told me you were looking for a job.

16:03.665 --> 16:04.985
I got this lucky charm from Yonghe Temple.

16:05.065 --> 16:06.385
It will boost your career.

16:09.585 --> 16:11.065
Thank you, Sun Yu.

16:11.145 --> 16:14.225
-I really need it.
-You are so amazing.

17:03.505 --> 17:04.665
Luke.

17:04.745 --> 17:05.905
I need to tell you something.

17:06.745 --> 17:07.825
An emergency?

17:07.905 --> 17:09.665
Qipai is very happy
with the annual plan we proposed.

17:10.865 --> 17:12.704
-So we sign now.
-No.

17:12.785 --> 17:13.865
Something bad happened.

17:16.665 --> 17:19.585
They plan to use our design proposal
for their secondary line brand.

17:19.665 --> 17:22.184
And they want a discount. 30% discount.

17:22.265 --> 17:23.184
No.

17:24.345 --> 17:26.265
Their Asia Pacific regional manager said

17:26.345 --> 17:28.985
that the secondary line brand
would be their main push this year.

17:29.065 --> 17:30.065
If our design proposal

17:30.145 --> 17:33.025
can help them boost this year's sales,

17:33.105 --> 17:35.425
next year, they'll let us
handle the marketing

17:35.505 --> 17:36.865
of all their brands under them.

17:36.945 --> 17:37.945
That's not good either.

17:40.065 --> 17:41.305
So we'll just lose the deal then.

17:42.025 --> 17:43.025
I'd rather lose them.

17:43.865 --> 17:46.625
They approved our proposal,
which means our ideas are good.

17:47.465 --> 17:50.025
They can choose to implement our proposals
on whichever product they want,

17:50.105 --> 17:51.385
but we won't give them a discount.

17:52.145 --> 17:54.265
Our ideas are not for hawking,

17:54.345 --> 17:56.065
where people expect us
to give them a huge discount.

17:56.745 --> 17:59.785
Okay. I'll confirm
the quotation with Finance.

18:02.745 --> 18:03.985
You look dashing today.

18:24.745 --> 18:26.105
Handle the file.

18:27.785 --> 18:29.505
-Morning, Luke.
-Morning, Luke.

18:31.905 --> 18:33.145
<i>So, he is Luke.</i>

18:37.785 --> 18:38.865
Morning, Luke.

18:43.585 --> 18:44.545
Morning.

18:56.865 --> 18:58.065
Luke.

18:59.025 --> 19:00.705
I'm the new recruit, Shang Zhitao.

19:00.785 --> 19:02.305
Thank you for recruiting me.

19:03.545 --> 19:05.785
No need to thank me.
I did not recruit you.

19:06.665 --> 19:08.585
In my eyes, you're not good enough.

19:11.705 --> 19:13.665
Then, I shall thank Lime
for this opportunity.

19:13.745 --> 19:14.865
I'll work hard.

19:17.065 --> 19:18.985
I hope you'll pass the probation,

19:19.545 --> 19:21.065
instead of just using us
to polish your resume before leaving.

19:26.305 --> 19:29.425
I am incredibly lucky and honored
to be able to work

19:29.505 --> 19:31.785
in this world-class advertising company.

19:31.865 --> 19:33.505
I will do my best to stay here.

19:38.225 --> 19:40.065
New hire? You know her?

19:41.865 --> 19:44.105
Why would I know a nobody
from the labor market?

19:47.745 --> 19:49.665
Who got him so upset
this early in the morning?

19:51.025 --> 19:52.345
We spoiled him, didn't we?

19:56.945 --> 19:58.065
Tracy.

20:05.105 --> 20:07.105
Welcome to Lime China.

20:07.185 --> 20:09.385
I am Liang Xin, the HR manager.

20:09.465 --> 20:11.865
In our company culture, we address
each other by our English names.

20:11.945 --> 20:13.305
So, please call me Tracy.

20:13.905 --> 20:17.625
Allow me to brief you and show you around.

20:18.305 --> 20:19.505
Come with me.

20:21.785 --> 20:24.905
What you're seeing now
is an introduction to our company.

20:25.705 --> 20:27.425
This is the Creative Division.

20:27.505 --> 20:28.625
Are you sure they want
to change it this way?

20:28.705 --> 20:30.305
It's the same as our first draft.

20:33.465 --> 20:34.305
START

20:34.385 --> 20:35.985
This is the Business Division.

20:36.065 --> 20:38.265
The busiest division in our company.

20:40.185 --> 20:42.625
I'll notify the supplier
about the client's request immediately

20:42.705 --> 20:44.025
so that they can find a new venue.

20:44.105 --> 20:44.825
The Commerce Division.

20:44.905 --> 20:45.825
We have a business negotiation
this afternoon.

20:45.905 --> 20:47.345
Get the collaboration proposal ready.

20:47.425 --> 20:48.145
Let's begin.

20:48.225 --> 20:49.425
This is the pantry.

20:49.505 --> 20:51.265
There's a lounge in the back.

20:51.785 --> 20:52.905
This is the public space.

20:52.985 --> 20:54.505
You can use it whenever you want.

20:54.585 --> 20:55.625
Recap of the situation. Last month…

20:55.705 --> 20:57.345
There are several restaurants
near the office.

20:57.425 --> 20:59.145
When you show your Lime work badge,
you'll get a 20% discount.

20:59.225 --> 21:02.025
You'll find the details
in the employee manual.

21:02.105 --> 21:03.825
Your probation period
will last for three months,

21:03.905 --> 21:05.345
and you'll rotate through divisions.

21:05.425 --> 21:07.865
Once you've decided to work
in a particular division,

21:07.945 --> 21:09.945
you may end the rotational shift.

21:10.025 --> 21:11.585
Have I made myself clear?

21:11.665 --> 21:12.585
Yes.

21:12.665 --> 21:15.545
Your first position
is in Business Division One.

21:15.625 --> 21:17.465
You will work under…

21:17.545 --> 21:18.465
Lumi.

21:18.545 --> 21:19.745
Tracy.

21:22.465 --> 21:23.345
Allow me to introduce.

21:24.065 --> 21:25.305
Lumi, your mentor.

21:25.385 --> 21:26.665
You'll be working for her.

21:27.465 --> 21:29.945
-Hi, madam.
-Wow.

21:30.025 --> 21:32.065
Are fresh graduates this nerdy nowadays?

21:32.145 --> 21:35.705
Perhaps you can show her
the true colors of corporate life.

21:35.785 --> 21:37.585
Please be nice to kids.

21:38.265 --> 21:39.425
Don't be like Luke.

21:40.145 --> 21:41.265
Tracy.

21:41.345 --> 21:44.505
Come on. I have no filter.

21:44.585 --> 21:47.225
But work is work.
Don't treat it like a joking matter.

21:47.305 --> 21:48.425
Worry not, madam.

21:48.505 --> 21:49.705
I'll work hard.

21:49.785 --> 21:50.945
All right.

21:51.025 --> 21:52.265
She'll work for me now.

21:52.345 --> 21:54.345
Come. Let me show you your desk.

21:55.105 --> 21:56.025
Don't worry.

21:57.985 --> 21:59.505
You'll sit here.

21:59.585 --> 22:00.905
Ms. Lumi.

22:00.985 --> 22:03.505
I am Shang Zhitao. Or Flora.

22:04.665 --> 22:06.465
No need to add "miss".

22:06.545 --> 22:08.265
Just call me Lumi.

22:08.345 --> 22:10.105
My English and Chinese names
are both Lumi.

22:11.945 --> 22:14.225
That row there
is the offices of all the bigwigs.

22:14.865 --> 22:18.225
And that one in particular, avoid it.

22:20.425 --> 22:21.745
Mr. Luan's office?

22:24.105 --> 22:25.185
You're smart.

22:25.825 --> 22:28.465
At work, just call him Luke.

22:28.545 --> 22:30.945
All right. I'll send you
some documents later.

22:31.025 --> 22:32.945
Familiarize yourself with our projects,

22:33.025 --> 22:34.665
and wait for my call.

22:35.545 --> 22:37.985
Oh. Report yourself to Luke first.

22:38.065 --> 22:41.625
While you do that,
conduct the interview as well.

22:41.705 --> 22:42.865
Compile your questions now.

22:42.945 --> 22:44.625
Interview?

22:44.705 --> 22:46.385
I will interview Luke?

22:46.465 --> 22:49.825
It is our tradition that the new hire
will interview the boss.

22:50.505 --> 22:52.345
Book an appointment with him today.

23:14.505 --> 23:15.745
Lumi.

23:16.345 --> 23:18.385
-You startled me.
-Sorry.

23:18.945 --> 23:23.625
I have a question.
Must I do the interview today?

23:26.345 --> 23:27.185
You're afraid of him?

23:28.945 --> 23:31.545
I heard he's quite strict.

23:31.625 --> 23:33.105
I'm just a bit worried.

23:35.665 --> 23:37.905
Creative people can be cranky.

23:37.985 --> 23:41.185
He's blunt, but he can be reasoned with.

23:41.265 --> 23:42.865
He won't devour you. Careful.

23:43.785 --> 23:45.985
He has already vented his anger today.

23:47.625 --> 23:49.865
He yelled at three people
until they cried at the morning meeting,

23:49.945 --> 23:51.545
so he probably won't yell again.

23:52.105 --> 23:55.505
What can I do to get along with him
if I don't want to be yelled at?

23:58.225 --> 23:59.665
Get along with him?

24:01.145 --> 24:02.145
Do you want to date him or something?

24:05.465 --> 24:06.905
You're blushing.

24:08.185 --> 24:09.025
I have one tip for you.

24:09.705 --> 24:12.545
At work, the more prideful your boss is,

24:12.625 --> 24:14.265
the more thick-skinned you have to be.

24:15.465 --> 24:16.505
Thick-skinned?

24:17.705 --> 24:18.905
Good luck.

24:46.305 --> 24:47.505
Come in.

24:55.105 --> 24:56.345
Hi, Luke.

24:56.425 --> 24:59.025
I am Shang Zhitao,
the new hire in Business Division One.

24:59.105 --> 25:00.145
You can call me Flora.

25:00.225 --> 25:01.745
Do you have time now?

25:01.825 --> 25:03.585
I have some questions for you.

25:04.425 --> 25:05.705
Is it urgent?

25:05.785 --> 25:07.225
Not really.

25:09.545 --> 25:10.625
Not urgent?

25:10.705 --> 25:11.625
Then, wait here.

25:43.745 --> 25:45.425
<i>She doesn't hide a thing.</i>

25:45.505 --> 25:48.025
<i>You won't find</i>
<i>someone so guileless in Lime.</i>

26:04.265 --> 26:05.705
Hello.

26:06.665 --> 26:07.825
<i>Luan Nian.</i>

26:07.905 --> 26:09.345
<i>I don't want to break up.</i>

26:09.425 --> 26:10.545
<i>Can we…</i>

26:10.625 --> 26:12.345
<i>Can we sit down and talk things through?</i>

26:12.425 --> 26:14.025
-Do not call me with a new number again.
<i>-Luan Nian!</i>

26:14.105 --> 26:15.065
<i>‎Luan--</i>

26:19.985 --> 26:21.065
Luke.

26:22.345 --> 26:23.185
Are you free now?

26:25.105 --> 26:25.985
You said it wasn't urgent.

26:27.585 --> 26:29.465
I assumed your time wasn't worth much,

26:29.545 --> 26:30.985
so your work could be deprioritized.

26:34.185 --> 26:35.345
I understand now.

26:35.425 --> 26:37.745
I will be direct about my needs
with you from now on.

26:37.825 --> 26:39.465
Thank you for the lesson.

26:39.545 --> 26:41.225
I did not teach you anything.
You may leave.

26:43.785 --> 26:46.345
Luke, according to the company's policy,

26:46.425 --> 26:48.585
you need to work with me as a new hire

26:48.665 --> 26:50.065
to have the interview.

26:50.145 --> 26:53.385
If you are not free today,
I'll follow up tomorrow.

26:53.465 --> 26:54.665
Just do it now.

26:57.025 --> 26:57.905
Sure.

27:00.985 --> 27:03.105
Why did you join Lime?

27:03.185 --> 27:04.145
The pay is great.

27:07.825 --> 27:08.665
The pay is great.

27:09.865 --> 27:13.145
-Do you like your job?
-No.

27:14.545 --> 27:17.025
Then, why are you staying?

27:19.145 --> 27:20.185
To make money and splurge.

27:23.385 --> 27:24.385
Okay.

27:24.985 --> 27:29.025
Allow me to share the projects I will be
joining in the future with you one by one.

27:29.105 --> 27:32.225
-I look forward to your further guidance.
-I will not guide you.

27:32.305 --> 27:33.345
You can just ask Lumi for anything.

27:34.265 --> 27:35.385
But I hope you can--

27:35.465 --> 27:37.425
Can you differentiate ROI and CVR?

27:37.505 --> 27:39.665
Can you use SWOT analysis
to market a product?

27:39.745 --> 27:42.625
Can you differentiate
between advertising channels?

27:43.945 --> 27:45.505
Sorry. Can you repeat?

27:45.585 --> 27:48.025
I'll take them down
and try to get back to you by tomorrow.

27:48.105 --> 27:50.025
If you really want a piece
of advice from me,

27:50.105 --> 27:52.145
it'll be to find a new job
as soon as possible.

27:52.665 --> 27:53.505
You're not fit for Lime.

28:01.465 --> 28:03.025
Why do you think

28:04.145 --> 28:05.145
I'm not a good fit?

28:11.265 --> 28:13.145
Academics-wise, you're average.

28:13.745 --> 28:15.825
Background-wise, you have no connections.

28:15.905 --> 28:18.745
Experience-wise, you have no experience
with large-scale advertising projects.

28:18.825 --> 28:20.305
What do you bring to the table?

28:20.905 --> 28:24.265
Why should I waste my time
on someone who will be replaced soon?

28:28.145 --> 28:29.465
I have been accepted into Lime.

28:29.545 --> 28:31.785
That means I must have some value.

28:32.425 --> 28:34.225
I will do my best to keep up with you.

28:34.305 --> 28:35.425
I won't waste your time.

28:35.505 --> 28:37.185
You're wasting everyone's time.

28:37.785 --> 28:39.105
You can't even understand what I'm saying.

28:39.185 --> 28:40.505
I don't deal with idiots.

28:42.065 --> 28:43.905
What kind of person do you like
to deal with then?

28:43.985 --> 28:45.985
-I can--
-I deal with jerks

28:46.065 --> 28:47.905
ike me. Can you do that?

28:53.305 --> 28:54.225
Okay.

28:55.185 --> 28:56.265
Duly noted.

28:56.345 --> 28:57.265
Thank you.

28:58.625 --> 28:59.505
I will go now.

29:10.985 --> 29:13.065
Sorry. I… I'll buy a new one.

29:15.785 --> 29:18.105
You can't afford it. Get out.

29:20.985 --> 29:22.185
Get out now.

29:35.345 --> 29:37.745
SHANG ZHITAO

29:44.465 --> 29:47.065
You must be the new intern.

29:48.105 --> 29:49.185
No, I'm not.

29:49.265 --> 29:51.505
I'm a full-time employee.

29:51.585 --> 29:53.345
Today is my first day.

29:53.425 --> 29:55.185
I am Shang Zhitao, Flora.

29:55.785 --> 29:56.745
Hi, I'm Jack.

29:57.425 --> 29:59.505
Are you free?
Can you get me a cup of coffee?

30:02.265 --> 30:03.185
Sure.

30:03.945 --> 30:04.945
Thank you.

30:05.025 --> 30:06.625
Does anyone else want coffee?

30:09.265 --> 30:10.225
You love making coffee that much?

30:11.425 --> 30:12.985
Why don't you make everyone
a cup of coffee?

30:13.705 --> 30:15.265
Lumi. Conference Room One.

30:15.345 --> 30:17.505
-Meeting in ten minutes.
-Noted.

30:18.345 --> 30:19.265
Iced Americano.

30:24.425 --> 30:28.185
Flora, from now on in this company,
ask me before you do anything.

30:28.265 --> 30:30.905
I am your mentor.
I'll tell you what to do.

30:30.985 --> 30:32.105
Do you hear me?

30:33.305 --> 30:34.745
-Yes.
-Don't be too meek.

30:34.825 --> 30:38.225
In this office,
people will bully the weak.

30:38.305 --> 30:40.145
The more sheepish you are,
the more they take advantage of you.

30:40.225 --> 30:41.745
They will then ask you to do
all the hard labor.

30:41.825 --> 30:42.665
You won't be able to take it.

30:44.985 --> 30:45.825
Have you conducted the interview?

30:47.145 --> 30:48.065
Yes.

30:48.865 --> 30:50.025
Lumi.

30:50.105 --> 30:53.785
Well, is the typewriter in Luke's office
very expensive?

30:53.865 --> 30:57.505
I ran into it just now,
and he said I could never afford it.

30:58.025 --> 30:59.265
You are quite something.

30:59.785 --> 31:00.985
He loves that thing.

31:01.065 --> 31:03.425
I'm not sure how expensive it is.

31:04.545 --> 31:05.985
Meeting first. We'll talk after.

31:19.105 --> 31:22.305
LEISURE WORK AREA

31:32.625 --> 31:33.745
MINUTES OF MANAGEMENT INTERVIEWS

31:33.825 --> 31:34.745
SEND

31:46.545 --> 31:48.105
Q&amp;A OF THE INTERVIEW

31:48.185 --> 31:49.225
QUESTIONING OF PERSONAL CAPABILITIES
AND FUTURE PROJECTS

31:49.305 --> 31:50.025
THE LEADER REPEATEDLY USED NEGATIVE

31:50.105 --> 31:50.705
AND AGGRESSIVE LANGUAGE
DURING THE INTERVIEW

31:59.225 --> 32:00.065
Hello?

32:00.145 --> 32:03.265
<i>You told the new hire</i>
<i>that you worked to splurge?</i>

32:03.345 --> 32:04.185
TO MAKE MONEY AND SPLURGE

32:04.265 --> 32:05.785
<i>Why are you staying</i>
<i>if you don't like the job?</i>

32:05.865 --> 32:07.145
<i>To make money and splurge.</i>

32:08.745 --> 32:10.025
What else?

32:10.105 --> 32:11.305
<i>And you told her to find a new job.</i>

32:11.385 --> 32:12.665
I ADVISE YOU TO GET A NEW JOB

32:12.745 --> 32:13.905
<i>You're not fit for Lime.</i>

32:14.705 --> 32:15.705
Is that a problem?

32:15.785 --> 32:17.265
<i>And you want her to be a jerk?</i>

32:18.025 --> 32:19.385
<i>What kind of person</i>
<i>do you like to deal with then?</i>

32:19.465 --> 32:21.385
<i>I deal with jerks.</i>

32:21.985 --> 32:22.905
Is that a problem?

32:23.425 --> 32:26.265
The advertisement industry needs us
to be bold and yet unfazed by anything.

32:26.345 --> 32:28.665
<i>Are you aware that your next promotion</i>
<i>is around the corner?</i>

32:28.745 --> 32:31.625
Does that have anything to do
with the interview?

32:31.705 --> 32:33.385
<i>Not directly,</i>

32:33.465 --> 32:36.065
<i>but you must respect</i>
<i>our diversity employment policy.</i>

32:36.145 --> 32:37.505
I respect that,

32:37.585 --> 32:39.505
but it has nothing to do
with my opinion of her.

32:39.585 --> 32:40.785
<i>What's so bad about her?</i>

32:40.865 --> 32:43.145
<i>It's her first day at work.</i>

32:43.225 --> 32:44.865
<i>If you weren't my junior,</i>

32:44.945 --> 32:47.825
<i>I would've reported you to the board</i>
<i>and asked them to fire you.</i>

32:48.345 --> 32:49.545
Go ahead.

33:03.905 --> 33:05.305
She's indeed an idiot.

33:16.025 --> 33:19.465
JINGHUANANJIE STATION
OPERATION HOURS: 05:30-22:00

33:22.505 --> 33:24.825
23:08, JUNE 21, THURSDAY

33:28.265 --> 33:31.745
LOWER CARBON, GREENER LIVING

33:34.305 --> 33:36.345
<i>If you really want</i>
<i>a piece of advice from me,</i>

33:36.425 --> 33:37.865
<i>it'll be to find a new job</i>
<i>as soon as possible.</i>

33:39.105 --> 33:40.065
You're not fit for Lime.

33:43.785 --> 33:45.225
<i>I'm staying, regardless.</i>

33:53.985 --> 33:55.745
Hang on. Where are you heading?

33:55.825 --> 33:56.745
I have to hand over the shift soon.

33:56.825 --> 33:58.665
I can't give you a ride
if we're not going the same way.

33:58.745 --> 34:00.505
Tiantongyuan. Is that okay?

34:00.585 --> 34:02.505
It's too far. Sorry.
I don't have enough petrol.

34:15.865 --> 34:17.705
Want a ride? Where to?

34:17.784 --> 34:20.665
-I… I'm going to Tiantongyuan.
-One hundred and twenty yuan.

34:21.545 --> 34:22.505
That's too expensive.

34:22.585 --> 34:23.985
Expensive?

34:24.065 --> 34:25.145
Do you know what time it is?

34:25.225 --> 34:26.264
No one goes there anymore.

34:26.344 --> 34:27.625
Hop in. Let's go.

34:39.304 --> 34:40.385
Hop in.

34:43.905 --> 34:46.185
No, thanks. I found a cab.

34:46.264 --> 34:48.145
It's illegal to stop here.

35:03.465 --> 35:05.465
He's driving a Mercedes-Benz
and yet he's stealing my business.

35:08.185 --> 35:10.105
JING Z 59Q00

35:13.305 --> 35:14.545
Fasten your seat belt.

35:28.145 --> 35:29.185
Thanks, Luke.

35:30.625 --> 35:32.305
You may drop me off in front.

35:32.905 --> 35:34.145
I'll hail a cab back.

35:35.945 --> 35:38.065
Drop you off so that you can get
into another scam cab?

35:39.105 --> 35:42.025
There was a piece of chewing gum
on that scammer's license plate.

35:42.105 --> 35:42.945
The O on it became a Q.

35:49.865 --> 35:51.625
Stop looking at it. Where do you stay?

35:54.625 --> 35:55.625
Luke.

35:55.705 --> 35:57.905
I live quite far away.

35:58.505 --> 35:59.665
My home is in Tiantongyuan.

35:59.745 --> 36:00.825
I don't want to trouble you.

36:03.145 --> 36:04.145
You don't want to trouble me?

36:04.665 --> 36:06.985
You wrote in the interview
that I asked you to quit.

36:08.825 --> 36:11.585
HR said I couldn't make things up
for the interview,

36:11.665 --> 36:13.865
so I was being honest.

36:17.705 --> 36:19.305
You can be quite crafty.

36:19.825 --> 36:20.705
Just a bit, though.

36:38.065 --> 36:40.225
TIANTONG DONGYUAN

36:40.305 --> 36:42.385
-Is this the place?
-Yes, it's here.

36:42.465 --> 36:44.465
-Get out.
-Thanks.

36:52.025 --> 36:53.305
Luke.

36:53.825 --> 36:55.745
I am not challenging your authority.

36:55.825 --> 36:58.425
I have noted down
everything you said today.

37:01.905 --> 37:02.745
You noted it down?

37:04.225 --> 37:07.025
Are you using it against me immediately
and being a jerk

37:07.105 --> 37:08.585
or to get back at me?

37:11.025 --> 37:15.265
No. HR told me
to write everything down truthfully.

37:16.305 --> 37:18.065
Being only truthful
won't make you last in this industry.

37:18.985 --> 37:19.865
You're not fit for Lime.

37:19.945 --> 37:20.985
That's my real advice.

37:21.745 --> 37:22.665
Go home now.

37:26.825 --> 37:27.945
You…

37:28.465 --> 37:30.185
Why do you hate me so much?

37:31.305 --> 37:33.705
Is it because I ruined your typewriter?

37:33.785 --> 37:35.225
I can compensate you.

37:35.305 --> 37:37.385
Can I pay you back
through monthly installments?

37:38.065 --> 37:39.305
It has nothing to do with it.

37:39.825 --> 37:40.905
And you don't need to compensate me.

37:43.985 --> 37:45.185
I'm so sorry.

37:48.265 --> 37:49.265
I won't quit.

37:49.345 --> 37:50.785
Thank you for the lift.

37:59.225 --> 38:02.065
<i>She looks meek,</i>
<i>as if anyone can bully her.</i>

38:02.585 --> 38:04.625
<i>But when she's mad, she will fight back.</i>

38:05.625 --> 38:06.665
<i>Just a little, that's all.</i>

39:21.505 --> 39:23.545
Sun Yu. Sun Yu.

39:25.545 --> 39:26.425
Sun Yu!

39:56.185 --> 39:57.385
Help!

40:33.385 --> 40:34.785
LOWER CARBON, GREENER LIVING

40:42.145 --> 40:45.305
I am incredibly lucky and honored
to be able to work

40:45.385 --> 40:47.665
in this world-class advertising company.

40:47.745 --> 40:49.665
I will do my best to stay here.

41:01.145 --> 41:02.185
Hop in.
